{"availability":"available","full":"linkwarden/linkwarden","name":"linkwarden","description":"⚡️⚡️⚡️ Self-hosted collaborative bookmark manager to collect, read, annotate, and fully preserve what matters, all in one place.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":19921,"forks":856,"created":"2022-04-09T07:53:01Z","updated":"2026-10-02T19:06:40Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://linkwarden.app","topics":["bookmark","bookmark-manager","collaboration","nextjs","react-native","read-it-later","self-hosted","typescript"],"demo":"https://demo.linkwarden.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T11:31:36.783Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T11:31:36.783Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T11:31:36.783Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:44:51.945Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Selfhosted","url":"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:44:51.945Z","stars":19905,"forks":857},{"at":"2026-10-04T11:31:36.783Z","stars":19921,"forks":856}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Linkwarden is a self-hosted, open-source collaborative bookmark manager to collect, read, annotate, and fully preserve what matters, all in one place.","The objective is to organize useful webpages and articles you find across the web in one place, and since useful webpages can go away (see the inevitability of Link Rot), Linkwarden also saves a copy of each webpage as a Screenshot and PDF, ensuring accessibility even if the original content is no longer available.","In addition to preservation, Linkwarden provides a user-friendly reading and annotation experience that blends the simplicity of a “read-it-later” tool with the reliability of a web archive. Whether you’re highlighting key ideas, jotting down thoughts, or revisiting content long after it’s disappeared from the web, Linkwarden keeps your knowledge accessible and organized."],"features":["📸 Auto capture a screenshot, PDF, and single html file of each webpage","📖 Reader view of the webpage, with the ability to highlight and annotate text","🏛️ Send your webpage to Wayback Machine (archive.org) for a snapshot (optional)","✨ Local AI Tagging to automatically tag your links based on their content (optional)","📂 Organize links by collection, sub-collection, name, description and multiple tags"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2813dd16022b0e23f9f2f19cbf216be22b201cb9a089cd3d38184dc7a62c7939","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:59:02.839Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:44:51.945Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Linkwarden is a self-hosted, open-source collaborative bookmark manager to collect, read, annotate, and fully preserve what matters, all in one place.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Cloud · Website · Self-Host · Docs","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Alternatively, if you prefer self-hosting Linkwarden, you can do so by following our Installation documentation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> [!IMPORTANT] > To use the app you’ll first need a Linkwarden account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"To create an account, you can choose between:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2813dd16022b0e23f9f2f19cbf216be22b201cb9a089cd3d38184dc7a62c7939","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linkwarden/linkwarden/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:44:51.945Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T19:06:40Z","enrich